x the prior 10-day average of 1.4M. It didn't hold. By May 6, 2010 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $32.03.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}